<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<title>Vos identifiants</title>
	</head>

	<div style="max-width:560px; margin:30px auto; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:28px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#333333;">
		<div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:25px;">
			<div style="font-size:24px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f3c88;">
				ENABEL
			</div>
			<div style="font-size:12px; color:#888888; margin-top:4px;">
				Plateforme de gestion
			</div>
		</div>
		<p style="font-size:15px; margin:0 0 15px;">
			Bonjour
			<strong>
				{{ user.firstname }}
				{{ user.lastname }}
			</strong>,
		</p>


		<p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 18px; color:#555555;">
    <strong style="color:#1f3c88;">
        Vos identifiants de connexion ont &eacute;t&eacute; g&eacute;n&eacute;r&eacute;s avec succ&egrave;s.
    </strong>
    <br>
    Voici vos informations de connexion :
</p>

		<div -style="background:#f7f8fa; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:20px;">
			<div style="margin-bottom:15px;">
				<div style="font-size:11px; color:#777777; margin-bottom:6px;">
					NOM D'UTILISATEUR
				</div>

				<div style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:6px; padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px;">

					<span style="font-weight:bold; color:#222222;">
						{{ username }}
					</span>

					<span style="float:right; color:#1f3c88; font-size:16px;">
						&#128203;
					</span>

				</div>

			</div>

			<div>
				<div style="font-size:11px; color:#777777; margin-bottom:6px;">
					MOT DE PASSE
				</div>

				<div style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:6px; padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px;">

					<span style="font-family:monospace; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;">
						{{ password }}
					</span>

					<span style="float:right; color:#1f3c88; font-size:16px;">
						&#128203;
					</span>

				</div>

			</div>

		 </div>
		<p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:#666666; margin:0;">
			Cordialement,<br>

			<strong style="color:#1f3c88;">
				L'&eacute;quipe ENABEL
			</strong>
		</p>

	</div>
</html>
